horts, making it a versatile wardrobe essential.</p>', '', 625.00, 625.00, NULL, '1 PC', NULL, NULL, 'all', 'acttive-mens-striped-polo-t-shirt-oa-732', NULL, NULL, NULL, 3, '2025-09-27 21:37:09', 0, 0, 0, '2025-03-21 22:47:39', '2025-09-27 21:39:56'),(247, 9, 0, 4, 'Acttive Men\'s Pique Striped Polo T-shirt', 'OA 733', 1, 1, 'public/uploads/product/1742557034.OA 1113.jpg', '<p>The ONN Active Polo T-Shirt features a sleek striped design that adds a touch of modern style to your wardrobe. Made from soft, breathable cotton fabric, it ensures comfort throughout the day. With a slim fit and half-sleeve style, this polo offers a flattering, tailored look while keeping you cool. The practical pocket adds convenience for small essentials, making it both stylish and functional. Ideal for casual outings or semi-formal gatherings, it pairs effortlessly with jeans, chinos, or shorts, making it a versatile wardrobe essential.</p>', '', 675.00, 675.00, NULL, '1 PC', NULL, NULL, 'all', 'acttive-mens-pique-striped-polo-t-shirt-oa-733', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, '2025-03-21 23:07:14', '2025-04-01 20:37:54'),(248, 6, 0, 9, 'ONN Platina Men\'s Microfiber Brief', 'OP 981', 1, 1, 'public/uploads/product/1742559312.2 (1).jpg', '<p>The ONN Platina Men\'s Microfiber Brief offers pure luxury on the skin with its soft, smooth, and lightweight fabric. Designed for ultimate comfort, the microfiber material ensures a snug fit while remaining breathable and gentle against the skin. Perfect for everyday wear, these briefs provide a sleek, modern look and are ideal for those who prioritize both comfort and style. With their premium feel and superior quality, the ONN Platina Men\'s Microfiber Briefs are a must-have for anyone seeking the perfect combination of luxury and practicality.</p>', '', 450.00, 450.00, NULL, '1 PC', NULL, NULL, 'all', 'onn-platina-mens-microfiber-brief-op-981', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, '2025-03-21 23:45:12', '2025-03-21 23:46:23'),(249, 11, 0, 9, 'Plati